+    // FastDDS can discover the request endpoint before the server has matched
+    // this short-lived client's response reader. An immediate state-changing
+    // request can then execute but lose its response (RMW_RET_TIMEOUT). Give
+    // discovery a bounded settling interval before sending, without retrying
